{"product_id":"rich-dads-increase-your-financial-iq","title":"Rich Dad's Increase Your Financial IQ","description":"\u003cp\u003eFor years, Robert Kiyosaki has firmly believed that the best investment one can ever make is in taking the time to truly understand how one's finances work. Too many people are much more interested in the quick-hitting scheme, or trying to find a short-cut to real wealth. As Kiyosaki has preached over and over again, one has to truly under the process of how money works before one can start out on trying to escape the daily financial Rat Race.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eNow, in this latest book in the popular Rich Dad Poor Dad series, Kiyosaki lays out his 5 key principles of Financial Intelligence for all to understand.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:25 x 170  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Robert T. Kiyosaki \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781612680668 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43521654587545,"sku":"13RE9781612680668","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/ebfabfc1835b0f0db2a6d72285c3e86a.jpg?v=1698161185","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/rich-dads-increase-your-financial-iq","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}